    {
        "role": "paragraph",
        "segment": "Resources available to users include formal documents and manuals (accessible in separate manuals or online) that contain all the information needed to use the system properly and efficiently, and are designed to be used as references when questions arise; users may read or consult these as needed, including online help, demonstrations, and classes, to learn how the system works.",
        "citations": [
