    },
    {
        "role": "bullet",
        "segment": "- False positives: items that seemed to be faults but in fact were not considered by the group to be true problems.",
        "citations": [
            {
                "type": "source_text",
                "content": "Sometimes faults discovered by an individual are considered to be 'false positives': items that seemed to be faults but in fact were not considered by the group to be true problems.",
