                "img_id": null
            }
        ],
        "type": null
    },
    {
        "role": "bullet",
        "segment": "Then, we can calculate measures of central tendency and dispersion on the data in the database, so we have some idea of the 'average' situation that is typical in our company.",
        "citations": [
